# Where Zoe is when the walk-off starts (zoe_ending.script, game flag 244):
# this bodiless object (object 17) floats 1550 above the courtyard floor,
# and DISTANCE ignores objects 1500 or more above or below, so it only sees
# her if she's up on the steps or the yard. Then she heads straight for the
# top of the steps (object 20) instead of back down through the courtyard.

== life
  IF FLAG_GAME(244) == 1 else @wait
  IF DISTANCE(0) < 30000 else @done_now
  SET_DIR_OBJ 0 2 20
done_now:
  SET_COMPORTEMENT @done
wait:
  END_COMPORTEMENT
done:
  END_COMPORTEMENT
  END
